{"id":46611,"date":"2025-11-15T15:27:51","date_gmt":"2025-11-15T14:27:51","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=46611"},"modified":"2026-09-17T22:59:22","modified_gmt":"2026-09-17T21:59:22","slug":"corrida-fim-da-europa","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-fim-da-europa\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida Fim da Europa 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Corrida Fim da Europa 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Corrida Fim da Europa 2027<\/strong> (36\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>31 de Janeiro de 2027<\/strong>, com partida marcada para as <strong>10:00<\/strong> na m\u00edtica <strong>Volta do Duche<\/strong>, junto ao Pal\u00e1cio da Vila de <strong>Sintra<\/strong>, e chegada triunfal no <strong>Cabo da Roca<\/strong>, o ponto mais ocidental do continente europeu. Organizada pela <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Sintra<\/strong> em parceria com a <strong>Podium Events<\/strong>, a prova \u00e9 considerada uma das mais belas e desafiantes corridas de estrada do mundo.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O percurso desenrola-se ao longo de <strong>17 km<\/strong> de puro encanto e supera\u00e7\u00e3o atrav\u00e9s do <strong>Parque Natural de Sintra-Cascais<\/strong>, confrontando os atletas com o constante relevo ondulante da serra (cerca de 400 metros de desn\u00edvel acumulado), estradas ladeadas por densa vegeta\u00e7\u00e3o e uma descida final deslumbrante em dire\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0 impon\u00eancia do Oceano Atl\u00e2ntico. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o assegura postos de abastecimento, seguran\u00e7a vi\u00e1ria, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica, transporte de regresso em autocarros e a cobi\u00e7ada medalha finisher aos participantes.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com um limite exclusivo de vagas e um prest\u00edgio que ultrapassa fronteiras desde 1987, a Corrida Fim da Europa \u00e9 uma experi\u00eancia \u00fanica onde &#8216;onde a terra se acaba e o mar come\u00e7a&#8217;.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">31 de Janeiro de 2027 \u00e0s 10:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Volta do Duche, Sintra (Meta: Cabo da Roca), Lisboa<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">17 km<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">C\u00e2mara Municipal de Sintra e Podium Events<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">2h30<\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida Fim da Europa &#8211; 17 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 31 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a Corrida Fim da Europa 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2027 est\u00e1 prevista para domingo, 31 de Janeiro de 2027, com partida na Volta do Duche (junto ao Pal\u00e1cio da Vila de Sintra) e meta instalada no m\u00edtico Cabo da Roca.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia e altimetria do percurso?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O percurso tem aproximadamente 17 km integralmente em asfalto pelo Parque Natural de Sintra-Cascais, apresentando um perfil altim\u00e9trico ondulante com cerca de 400 metros de subidas acumuladas e descida final pronunciada at\u00e9 ao mar.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona o transporte de regresso dos atletas no final?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza autocarros vaiv\u00e9m (shuttles) gratuitos a partir do Cabo da Roca ap\u00f3s a conclus\u00e3o da corrida, transportando os participantes de regresso ao centro de Sintra.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso efetuar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e consultar o regulamento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais e o regulamento definitivo ser\u00e3o disponibilizados no portal oficial http:\/\/www.fimdaeuropa.com\/ e na plataforma Lap2Go aquando da abertura formal das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui o kit de atleta e a participa\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o contempla dorsal oficial com chip, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, abastecimentos de s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos durante e ap\u00f3s o percurso, seguro desportivo, transporte p\u00f3s-meta e a medalha exclusiva de finalista no Cabo da Roca.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Corrida Fim da Europa 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-01-31\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Volta do Duche, Sintra (Meta: Cabo da Roca)\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Sintra\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"C\u00e2mara Municipal de Sintra e Podium Events\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a Corrida Fim da Europa 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2027 est\u00e1 prevista para domingo, 31 de Janeiro de 2027, com partida na Volta do Duche (junto ao Pal\u00e1cio da Vila de Sintra) e meta instalada no m\u00edtico Cabo da Roca.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia e altimetria do percurso?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O percurso tem aproximadamente 17 km integralmente em asfalto pelo Parque Natural de Sintra-Cascais, apresentando um perfil altim\u00e9trico ondulante com cerca de 400 metros de subidas acumuladas e descida final pronunciada at\u00e9 ao mar.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funciona o transporte de regresso dos atletas no final?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza autocarros vaiv\u00e9m (shuttles) gratuitos a partir do Cabo da Roca ap\u00f3s a conclus\u00e3o da corrida, transportando os participantes de regresso ao centro de Sintra.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso efetuar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e consultar o regulamento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais e o regulamento definitivo ser\u00e3o disponibilizados no portal oficial http:\/\/www.fimdaeuropa.com\/ e na plataforma Lap2Go aquando da abertura formal das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui o kit de atleta e a participa\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o contempla dorsal oficial com chip, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, abastecimentos de s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos durante e ap\u00f3s o percurso, seguro desportivo, transporte p\u00f3s-meta e a medalha exclusiva de finalista no Cabo da Roca.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":67540,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,559],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-46611","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-sintra-lisboa","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-de-15-km","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/cartaz-corrida-fim-da-europa.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/46611","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www